{
  "uid": "fak-router",
  "title": "FAK Router | Unified model routing",
  "tags": [
    "fak",
    "router",
    "serving"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Fleet bottleneck",
      "url": "/d/fleet-bottleneck",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Gateway observability",
      "url": "/d/fak-gateway-observability",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Fak Ops",
      "url": "/d/fak-ops",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 2,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "options": [],
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Unified router: live routing traffic, backend health, and failover",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Telemetry from the SCM-supervised router on `127.0.0.1:18101`, scraped under the `fak_router` job. **This board is built on the router's own `fak_router_*` families** - the counters that actually move when the router forwards to third-party upstreams (hive-ai, nebius, opencode-go, ...). The older `fak_gateway_*` proxy counters (requests, streaming requests, upstream token totals, net-win gauges) are **structurally zero in routing mode** and are deliberately not plotted here: reading them made a busy router look idle. **Unavailable means missing evidence**, not zero: an absent series means the router did not report it, not that traffic is idle.\n\nCommon stats: **RPS** (now), **RPM** (1-minute rate), per-backend request share, error rate, attempt latency p50/p95, time-to-first-byte p50/p95, terminal-outcome mix, and failover rate."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic: live rate, volume, and concurrency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Router scrape (1 = reachable)",
      "description": "Prometheus reachability of the SCM-supervised router listener on :18101. 0 means the router is up but unreachable to the container, or down; it is the scrape witness, not readiness.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"fak_router\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests per second (RPS)",
      "description": "**The headline RPS**: upstream attempts per second the router is currently making, summed across every backend. In routing mode this is the real request rate (one logical request can fan into several attempts across a fallback chain, so attempt-rate is a slight upper bound on request-rate). A flat 0 with *Router scrape* = 1 means genuine quiescence.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 3,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(fak_router_attempts_total{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "attempts/s",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests per minute (RPM)",
      "description": "**RPM**: the same attempt counter averaged over a fixed 1-minute window, times 60. Use this for capacity/throughput reporting where per-second noise is not useful. It is a rate over a fixed window, not the per-second rate the RPS panel shows.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 7,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(fak_router_attempts_total{job=\"fak_router\"}[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "attempts/min",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Success rate",
      "description": "Share of terminal requests that succeeded (`served` or `served_fallback`) over all terminal requests, windowed. **The headline health number**: 1.0 is all success, and a drop is a serving problem. Read the outcome panel below to see which loss band grew.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 11,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(fak_router_requests_total{job=\"fak_router\",outcome=~\"served|served_fallback\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(fak_router_requests_total{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "success",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total requests",
      "description": "Cumulative **routed** requests the router has completed across every terminal outcome, from `fak_router_requests_total`. This is the routing-mode request total (unlike the structurally-zero `fak_gateway_requests_total` proxy counter it replaces). In-flight requests are not yet counted here; see *In flight now*.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 15,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(fak_router_requests_total{job=\"fak_router\"})",
          "legendFormat": "requests",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Routing attempts (all backends)",
      "description": "Cumulative upstream attempts since process start, across every backend, status, and fallback hop. **This is the router's real demand signal in routing mode** - one logical request can fan into several attempts across a failover chain, so this is >= the request total. A rising value with *Total requests* flat is the routing path, not an outage.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(fak_router_attempts_total{job=\"fak_router\"})",
          "legendFormat": "attempts",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "In flight now",
      "description": "Routed requests currently in flight (admitted, not yet terminal) - the router's live concurrency. A sustained high value with a low RPS means upstreams are slow, not that traffic is high.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 21,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "fak_router_inflight_requests{job=\"fak_router\"}",
          "legendFormat": "in flight",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-backend health and error rate",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Backends: live health",
      "description": "One row per configured backend: live in-flight attempts, consecutive failures since last success, seconds since the backend last succeeded, total attempts, and how many of those were fallback hops. A backend with consecutive_failures > 0 and a growing seconds_since_success is failing over rather than serving. Series join on the `backend` label.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "fak_router_backend_inflight{job=\"fak_router\"}",
          "legendFormat": "in_flight",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "fak_router_backend_consecutive_failures{job=\"fak_router\"}",
          "legendFormat": "consecutive_failures",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "time() - fak_router_backend_last_success_timestamp_seconds{job=\"fak_router\"}",
          "legendFormat": "seconds_since_success",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum without (fallback, status) (fak_router_attempts_total{job=\"fak_router\"})",
          "legendFormat": "attempts_total",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "sum without (fallback, status) (fak_router_attempts_total{job=\"fak_router\",fallback=\"true\"})",
          "legendFormat": "fallback_attempts",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors per second by backend",
      "description": "Per-second rate of failed upstream attempts, split by backend, from `fak_router_attempt_failures_total`. This is the router's own view of backend errors and is populated in routing mode (the structurally-zero `fak_gateway_*` counters are not used here). See the failure-class panel below for *why* they failed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (backend) (rate(fak_router_attempt_failures_total{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Upstream error rate",
      "description": "Share of upstream attempts that failed, windowed - the attempt-level error rate (a request can retry the next backend after a failed attempt, so this is deliberately separate from the request-level *Success rate*). A rising value means backends are rejecting or timing out.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(fak_router_attempt_failures_total{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(fak_router_attempts_total{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "attempt errors",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Attempt duration p50 / p95 by backend",
      "description": "End-to-end upstream attempt duration (including body relay) at the 50th and 95th percentile, per backend, from `fak_router_attempt_duration_seconds`. This covers the whole attempt, so it tracks streamed response length as well as upstream speed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, backend) (rate(fak_router_attempt_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{backend}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, backend) (rate(fak_router_attempt_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{backend}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time to first byte p50 / p95 by backend",
      "description": "Time to response headers (time-to-first-byte) per backend, from `fak_router_attempt_ttfb_seconds`. This is the responsiveness an operator feels before decode starts; a high p95 here is upstream latency, not the router's own overhead.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, backend) (rate(fak_router_attempt_ttfb_seconds_bucket{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{backend}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, backend) (rate(fak_router_attempt_ttfb_seconds_bucket{job=\"fak_router\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{backend}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
